Hint:"Usual location on this computer; not found there or not confirmed",newerTitle:"Installed companion is newer than this extension",newerBody:(x,_)=>`Installed ${x} · bundled ${_}. Nothing changes on its own. Choosing the bundled version would go back to an older companion; updating this extension is usually the better fix.`,rebuildTitle:"Different companion build available",rebuildBody:(x)=>`This extension bundles a different build of version ${x}. Nothing changes until you review and confirm.`,upgradeTitle:"Companion update available",upgradeBody:(x,_)=>`Installed ${x} → bundled ${_}. Nothing changes until you review and confirm.`,review:"Review",reviewUpdate:"Review update",installedVersion:"Installed version",bundledVersion:"Bundled version",noComparison:"The service has not compared the bundled companion with the installed one, so this review cannot say which version updating selects.",same:"The bundled companion has the same files as the installed one, so updating changes nothing.",rebuild:"Same version number, different files: updating selects the bundled files.",downgrade:"The bundled companion is older than the installed one. Choosing it goes back to that version.",updateEffect:"Updating keeps these folders, your plans and history, and switches only the companion files. Agents use the new files once OpenCode loads the companion again.",switchEffect:"Switching keeps these folders, your plans and history, and changes only the companion files. Agents use them once OpenCode loads the companion again.",reload:"OpenCode has not loaded the current companion files yet. Restart OpenCode when convenient so agents use them; sessions already running may keep earlier files until then. This view does not restart anything.",foldersNeeded:"Folders needed",unchanged:"Setup did not change anything",partial:"Setup only partly finished",dismiss:"Dismiss",done:"Done.",disabled:"Capture is off.",enabled:"Capture is on.",removedNotice:"Capture removed. History is kept.",review